{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）凌晨4時31分，警方接報粉嶺靈山路一間鐵皮屋起火。消防員到場出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊灌救，約49分鐘後將火救熄，初步相信火警與電線有關；其間36男42女，與及一批貓狗疏散到安全地方。</p><p>至清晨6時26分，警方指，一名中年男子被發現當場不治，警方正調查死者身份及致死原因。其間靈山路一名12歲女童頭暈，被送到北區醫院治理，經查證與火警無關。</p><p>根據網上影片和圖片所見，現場火光熊熊，消防接報到場撲火。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場火光熊熊。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159037248671453184759283.jpeg/zdNlxhiTtC4zjqxVgwf6GS35EOM__3tPdJKNiHSSjYg\"/><figcaption>現場火光熊熊。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040227310833664372514.jpeg/6dTETl_OX7yWOP7e5HZHboIBzxQ6cyTOmoSzBpqEswY\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040229634609152216840.jpeg/WD4AElrhWk3_vQy_VB6LdWT_cboiBys7pi81_6YvNf8\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159037246318317568378549.jpeg/0D1-ZZMUaDZBCm2gO749iYthcrafubjSfRwjI30cIyM\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"早上有居民在場登記。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048719048380416206145.jpeg/jvPX7lS3cG82phdLt0Ndm5KZW-rDI4snq8zaLqvM2i4\"/><figcaption>早上有居民在場登記。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警後警方協助居民登記。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048721598648320169720.jpeg/R3Onn4xAK0EKtOfet6n-GLYq-3StgT1eij5gGoo-YBo\"/><figcaption>火警後警方協助居民登記。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049909794508800680315.jpeg/YjxAxXF-f5yhDzn6I1CnIC1OIJ0sgMn7PlDedz5Q3nc\"/><figcaption>消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049330259136512021587.jpeg/NzSHGoUQZLGhDqbGobaUENrmcnJh_qS3GPAtRxjwLUc\"/><figcaption>有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048723960172544634287.jpeg/E_Q7zNlDJy_tePU-kE0qilCOmKaKRNHrPb9EMj2_RDI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048726145536000518604.jpeg/-yHW5BRu9nnKFzOPTr0ZlJGRdwYb77TSczZ9EnM2fRI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名12歲女童頭暈，已被送到北區醫院接受治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159035700604047360685297.jpeg/aUb0vBxbVBpQJtnq0nYwPL8_vQSMXctC7wcQFNUHEBQ\"/><figcaption>一名12歲女童頭暈，已被送到北區醫院接受治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T00:19:02.351112+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":612,"images":11,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}